TachiVF is an independent project and is not an official Keiyoushi distribution.

Local changes: project name and documentation, Gradle distribution download URL
and checksum, development scripts, CI workflow, ignore rules, and removal of
trailing spaces on two upstream lines (no behavioral change).

The catalogue schema and generated Python bindings in scripts/index.proto and
scripts/index_pb2.py are also imported from the same upstream revision.
